        <h3><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> How it Works</h3>
        <p>Simple 3-node workflow in n8n:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Webhook Node (GET):</strong> Receives the HTTP request</li>
          <li><strong>Code Node:</strong> Generates the HTML interface</li>
          <li><strong>Respond to Webhook Node:</strong> Returns HTML as binary file</li>
        </ul>

        <h3><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> The Agent Buttons</h3>
        <p>Three specialized agents for different tasks:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Database Agent:</strong> Searches your database, runs SQL queries</li>
          <li><strong>Web Agent:</strong> Searches the internet for current information</li>
          <li><strong>RAG Agent:</strong> Searches your documents and knowledge base</li>
        </ul>

        <h3><i class="fas fa-plug"></i> Connecting to Your Workflow</h3>
        <p>
          Update the JavaScript functions <code>sendMessage()</code> and <code>sendToAgent()</code>
